These are used daily in SAP systems (Linux servers):
✅ System Monitoring
Bash
top            # Real-time CPU/memory usage
htop           # Better version of top
uptime         # System load
free -m        # Memory usage
✅ Disk & Storage
Bash
df -h          # Disk space
du -sh *       # Folder size
lsblk          # Disk info
✅ Process Management
Bash
ps -ef | grep <process>
kill -9 <PID>
nice / renice
✅ File Handling
Bash
ls -lrt
cp / mv / rm
cat / less / tail -f logfile.log
find / -name filename
